  "_comment_payg": "P371: the pay-as-you-go preset (standard /api/v3, billed per token, any program may call it — unlike the plan address). Model ids, image input and limits read from GET /api/v3/models on 2026-10-17 (that endpoint is also the read-only key check). OpenCode's built-in `volcengine` provider reads the same ARK_API_KEY but its list lacks the newest ids (no doubao-seed-2-1-pro-260915 in 1.18.34), so this is our own `ark-api` block. One Ark API key works on both addresses: the address decides whether the plan or the balance pays.",
